# Numbers suite 05 -- a decimal literal of 2^64 does not fit in 64 bits and is a compile
# error, not a value clamped to INT64_MAX (NUM-001).
#
# Today the error is reported through the COMP-001 assert in file mode; the
# message is checked, not the way the process exits.
#
# EXPECT: error: integer literal out of range

x := 18446744073709551616
